      "content": "it just feels like there's no way back from this. like the person i was before all this success and pressure is just gone, and what's left is just... this hollow version of me. everything feels so heavy. i find myself thinking that the only way to actually get some real peace, like true silence from all the noise and the expectations, would be to just... not have to deal with any of it anymore. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
